    "description": {
      "value": "<p><strong>Archery:</strong> one arrow at a time, nocked as part of the Attack action (no Reload Action). Load a stack of arrows and reload after each shot.</p><p>Grown, not built: there's no metal in it, so scanners and metal detectors miss it. Each dawn, after a day with a few hours of sunlight, it grows <strong>three Basic Arrows</strong> from its limbs. Loads Non-Basic arrows too.</p><p><em>A Biotechnica Flats lab grew it to prove it could. The lab sells them now, to people who don't ask how.</em></p><p><strong>Class:</strong> Exotic Bow • POWER<br><strong>Range table:</strong> Bow<br><strong>Damage:</strong> 4d6<br><strong>Built-in:</strong> Power Rebuild</p><p><small>Item Compendium (2070) • Weapons</small></p>"
